### Scenary 后端冒烟脚本（IDEA HTTP Client / docs 03-P3 验收件）
### 用法：在 IDEA 中按序执行；{{accessToken}} 等变量由前序响应脚本捕获。
### 配套可编程版本见同目录 test-*.mjs（Node fetch 直驱，可重复执行）。

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 0. ping —— 期望 {"code":0,...}
GET {{host}}/ping

### 0b. actuator health（compose healthcheck 同款路径）
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 1. 注册（改用户名避免重名）→ 捕获双令牌
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smoke_a",
  "password": "Passw0rd123",
  "nickname": "冒烟甲"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

### 1b. 重名注册 → 41001
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "smoke_a", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

### 2. 登录
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "smoke_a", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

### 3. 刷新旋转 → 旧 refreshToken 复放应得 40101
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 4. 登出（吊销白名单+黑名单当前 access）
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. 上传两张图（手动替换本地真实 png/jpg 文件路径）
POST {{host}}/media/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="a.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/a.png
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="b.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/b.png
--boundary--

> {%
    client.global.set("mediaId1", String(response.body.data.items[0].mediaId));
%}

### 5b. 魔数欺骗（文本伪装 jpg）→ 40000
# 手工构造或经 test-media36.mjs 覆盖

### 6. 轮询媒体状态 → status 从 0 到 1（缩略图消费者完成后）
GET {{host}}/media/{{mediaId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. 发布笔记 → {"id":..., "coverUrl":"...thumb..."}
POST {{host}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "雨后的四姑娘山",
  "content": "十月初的雪线，云开了一小时。",
  "placeName": "四川·四姑娘山",
  "mediaIds": [{{mediaId1}}]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("noteId", String(response.body.id));
%}

### 7b. 私密笔记创建（visibility=0，02 v2.3 补充字段）
POST {{host}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "私密底稿", "content": "", "mediaIds": [{{mediaId1}}], "visibility": 0 }

### 8. feed 第一页 / 游标翻页
GET {{host}}/feed

###
GET {{host}}/feed?limit=10&cursor=999999

### 9. 笔记详情（匿名 mine=false；带 token mine=true）
GET {{host}}/notes/{{noteId}}

###
GET {{host}}/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9b. 未处理完的媒体发布 → 40901；用他人媒体 → 40300；空标题 → 40000

### 10. 用户公开主页 / 网格（含可选 token 私密增强）
GET {{host}}/users/1
###
GET {{host}}/users/1/notes?limit=12
###
GET {{host}}/users/1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. 我的资料编辑 → 回读完整 me
PATCH {{host}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "新昵称", "bio": "新签名" }

### 11b. 空 PATCH → 40000 至少一项
PATCH {{host}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12. 头像上传（200x200 居中裁切）
POST {{host}}/users/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="me.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/a.png
--boundary--

### 13. 删除笔记（幂等）
DELETE {{host}}/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. 受保护路径无令牌 → 401/40100
GET {{host}}/users/me

### 15. 方法不匹配 → 405/包络40000
POST {{host}}/ping
